# Project Overview
This is a BPMN (Business Process Model and Notation) engine built as a monorepo with two main packages:
- `web/`: A modern SPA frontend using React, Vite, TypeScript, and bpmn-js for business process modeling and execution.
- `server/`: A Node.js API backend built with TypeScript and LoopBack 4, designed for modular, maintainable business process APIs.
